  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Firearms related Investigations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen firearms investigations and the operations of the Firearms Focal Point in Pristina through provision of technical advice for enhancing the data collection and analytical capacities as well as through the provision of specialized equipment. More specifically, it aims at i) improving data collection and analysis by the Firearms Focal Point; ii) improving detection of weapons hidden underground; and iii) improving examination of seized firearms by ballistic department</narrative>
  </description>
